---
// Pie de página con enlaces de navegación y redes
---

<footer class="bg-white dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border-t border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border py-12 sm:py-16 transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 sm:gap-10 pb-10 sm:pb-12 border-b border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border">
      
      <div class="md:col-span-5 reveal-init">
        <a href="#top" class="inline-block mb-4">
          <img src="/assets/img/logo.png" alt="Slimergy Logo" class="logo-light h-14 sm:h-16 w-auto object-contain" />
          <img src="/assets/img/logo-dark.png" alt="Slimergy Logo Dark" class="logo-dark h-14 sm:h-16 w-auto object-contain" />
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted font-medium max-w-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          El poder de ahorrar empieza con medir. Sistema de monitoreo de energía inteligente para hogares mexicanos.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted">Proyecto Innovatec 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3 reveal-init reveal-d1">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-slimergy-main dark:text-white mb-3 sm:mb-4">Navegación</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted">
          <li><a href="#como-funciona" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Cómo funciona</a></li>
          <li><a href="#caracteristicas" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Características</a></li>
          <li><a href="#hardware" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Hardware</a></li>
          <li><a href="#demo" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Demo</a></li>
          <li><a href="#cuartos-demo" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Simulador de Cuartos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#tarifa-cfe" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Calculadora CFE</a></li>
          <li><a href="#equipo" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Equipo</a></li>
          <li><a href="#mision" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Misión &amp; Visión</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4 reveal-init reveal-d2">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-slimergy-main dark:text-white mb-3 sm:mb-4">Contacto y Redes</h4>
        <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
          <a 
            href="https://www.instagram.com/slimergy_26/" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener" 
            class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white hover:text-slimergy-green-hover dark:hover:text-slimergy-green transition-colors"
          >
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-slimergy-green-light dark:bg-slimergy-green/15 text-slimergy-green flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/>
                <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/>
                <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>Instagram @slimergy_26</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-slimergy-main dark:text-white mb-3">Stack Técnico</h4>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 sm:gap-2">
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-mono bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">ESP32</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-mono bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">PZEM-004T</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-mono bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">MQTT</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-mono bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">React Native</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-mono bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-mono bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">HiveMQ</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-mono bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">Expo SDK 50</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-mono bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-card px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">CFE DAC 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="pt-6 sm:pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 sm:gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted text-center sm:text-left">
      <span>© 2026 Slimergy · Proyecto Innovatec · Todos los derechos reservados</span>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="#top" class="hover:text-slimergy-main dark:hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Volver arriba</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 10l7-7m0 0l7 7m-7-7v18"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
